---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { company } from '../config';
---
<Base title="About" description="DNA Engineering is a BMS controls engineering company based in Telford, Shropshire.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>About DNA Engineering</h1>

      <div class="todo">
        <p>
          <!-- TODO(Dan): rewrite in your own words. Keep it honest and specific. -->
          DNA Engineering is a BMS controls company based in {company.location}. The engineer who
          writes the software is the one on site commissioning it, so nothing is lost between design and handover.
        </p>
        <p>
          [Your background: years in controls, the platforms you've worked on, the kinds of
          buildings, and why you set up DNA Engineering.]
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>One point of contact from strategy through to handover</li>
        <li>Clear documentation: strategies, point schedules, drawings and O&amp;M information</li>
        <li>Flexible: full packages or individual parts for M&amp;E and controls contractors</li>
      </ul>

      <!-- TODO(Dan): accreditations, insurance, CSCS/ECS cards, H&S schemes (e.g. CHAS, SafeContractor) if held -->
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
